#. ボクがクマになる前の話をしましょう。
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Let's talk a bit about where I was at before I became\n"
"a bear."
msgstr ""

#. 最初はね…迷ってたんだ。
#. 自分は何になるべきか迷ってたんだ。
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"At first, I was at a total loss. I just had no idea\n"
"what I should become!"
msgstr ""

#. サポートセンターのお姉さんはエビを推してたんだよ。
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"A lady in our tech support department suggested I try\n"
"being a shrimp. She was like..."
msgstr ""

#. 我が社が長年温めてきた最上級のアイデアですって…
#. これは破格のオファーなんですよ…だって。
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, the company's been trying to push for this\n"
"forever! It's a really incredible offer!\""
msgstr ""

#. でもね、よくよく話を聞いてみたら…
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But as she laid out all the details, it turned out..."
msgstr ""

#. クルマエビじゃなくて、
#. サクラエビだったんだよ！！
msgctxt "0006 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...it wasn't a tiger prawn like I'd hoped, but a\n"
"little popcorn shrimp!"
msgstr ""

#. 小さいよ！　世界最小のマスコットだよ！
msgctxt "0007 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's totally tiny! I would've been the world's\n"
"smallest mascot!"
msgstr ""

#. 食べるのはともかく、エビになるなんて嫌だよ！
#. しかも、サクラエビなんて、踏まれて終わりだし！
msgctxt "0008 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I like EATING shrimp, I didn't wanna be one myself!\n"
"Plus someone might come along and step on me..."
msgstr ""

#. そうしたら、サポートセンターのお姉さんは、
#. 鼻で笑いながら言うんだ。
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So then the lady totally started laughing at me!"
msgstr ""

#. お客様のご予算では、
#. クルマエビはとてもじゃないけど無理です…だって。
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"She was like, \"You think we can do a tiger prawn on\n"
"*our* budget?\""
msgstr ""

#. なので、最終的にクマを選びました。
msgctxt "0011 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So ultimately, I decided to become a bear instead."
msgstr ""

#. …モノクマ誕生秘話でした。
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And that's the secret origin story of Monokuma..."
msgstr ""
